      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAZMAS (3) has the most convincing recent profile, having been beaten a length and a half and just over a length in consecutive NMW1Y runs at this track. The latest came in Saturday company after he was tightened early and raced keenly, so coming back to this CL3 gives him a strong platform. MORE HEROIC (9) brings winning form after scoring in a CL1 at this track, doing it despite racing wide throughout, and the return of Shaun McGruddy is another plus. SAFARI BOY (5) just missed at Moora two back before maybe not relishing the rise in trip last start. Back in trip looks a good move and from an inside draw, he can bounce back to form. MISTRESS OF WAR (2) comes here with one win and three places from five starts at this track and distance and lands here third-up with a good platform beneath her. SPACE ACADEMY (6) is racing well without winning this time in and can't be discounted.",
